{
"#tip:note"
:
[
{
"en"
:
"tdown is short for teardown — it reverses what setup did:\n1. Remove x-cmd prompts from ~/.agents/AGENTS.md, ~/CLAUDE.md, ~/.codex/AGENTS.md, ~/.gemini/GEMINI.md, ~/.config/opencode/AGENTS.md\n2. Remove skills/skill0 symlinks under ~/.agents, ~/.claude, ~/.codex, ~/.config/opencode, ~/.openclaw\n3. Remove empty skills directories\nEmpty markdown files are kept; unify-generated ~/AGENTS.md and symlinks are not affected.\n"
}
]
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x agent tdown"
,
"en"
:
"Example: Tear down x-cmd agent configuration"
}
]
}

